  "as_of": "2023-06-14",
  "sentences": [
   "The bill would amend rules for financial advice qualifications, credit product intervention orders, clearing and settlement services and the First Home Super Saver Scheme.",
   "It would prohibit schemes avoiding credit product intervention orders and give financial regulators rule-making and arbitration powers for clearing and settlement service access.",
   "Qualifying experienced financial advisers would be exempt from further study to meet the qualifications standard, while still having to pass examinations and maintain professional development."
  ],
  "changes": [
   "Home savers could generally amend or withdraw release applications before the tax commissioner begins paying them.",
   "The post-contract deadline to request a home saver release authority would increase from 14 days to 90 days.",
   "Registered tax agents who are financial advisers would avoid duplicated education requirements for tax advice.",
   "Credit product intervention order avoidance would attract civil penalties and criminal offences."
  ],
  "affected": "Financial advisers, retail clients, credit providers, clearing and settlement operators and first home savers are affected.",
